{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2023-03-28 09:02:00', 'title': "PPG'S U.S. WOODCARE BRANDS ANNOUNCE CHESTNUT BROWN AS 2023 STAIN COLOR OF THE YEAR", 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE: PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS OLYMPIC® STAINS BY PPG AND PITTSBURGH PAINTS & STAINS® BRANDS HAVE SELECTED CHESTNUT BROWN AS THEIR 2023 STAIN COLOR OF THE YEAR. BALANCING BETWEEN RETRO AND ELEGANT, THIS RICH COLOR COMPLEMENTS TRENDS OF WARM MINIMALISM AND EARTHY HUES AND CAN BE USED TO HELP HOMEOWNERS CREATE AN AESTHETIC THAT IS ON-TREND WITH POPULAR DESIGN STYLES.'}